WEBVTT

00:03:58.276 --> 00:04:01.404
mandatory minimums were put in place.

00:04:01.404 --> 00:04:03.072
And that's what we have now.

00:04:03.114 --> 00:04:06.117
And we went on a sort of stratospheric,

00:04:06.117 --> 00:04:09.203
700-percent increase
in the prison population

00:04:09.245 --> 00:04:10.746
over the course of the 50 years

00:04:10.746 --> 00:04:14.709
between the early '70s and the aughts.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:19.130
And here's the thing that we should know,

00:04:19.171 --> 00:04:20.673
is that we did it.

00:04:21.048 --> 00:04:23.092
This is a product of democracy.

00:04:23.592 --> 00:04:25.094
It did not have to be this way,

00:04:25.136 --> 00:04:29.056
but we elected people who promised us

00:04:29.098 --> 00:04:31.934
that safety and order could be delivered